# ============================================================
# PORTFOLIO ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION EXAMPLE
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values.
# ALL variables are optional — without env, the application still runs
# using default data from src/dearlyfebriano/data/profile.ts.
# ============================================================

# --- Admin "Manage" mode (guestbook & contact) ---------------
# Key for "Manage" mode (shield button) on Guestbook and
# Contact (section "Recent messages"). GET + DELETE on
# /api/contact and DELETE /api/guestbook requires header
# x-admin-key matching this value.
# Without env, default: dearlyfebriano08
# ADMIN_DELETE_KEY=your-secret-admin-key

# --- GitHub (optional, recommended in production) ------------
# Personal access token. Unauthenticated GitHub API is limited
# to 60 requests/hour per IP; project intelligence fetches a
# repository tree plus source files and will exceed that quickly.
# Classic token: public_repo (or repo for private repositories).
# Fine-grained token: Contents + Metadata read on the org/repos.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=g*************************
